# Build output. Committed: the circuit json, the vk, the SHA256SUMS digests,
# the .srs.toolchain marker, and the Solidity verifier (forge compiles every
# script under ../script, so it must exist in a fresh checkout).
#
# NOT committed: the .srs. At 2^21 it is 134,217,940 bytes, and GitHub refuses
# any file over 100 MiB (docs.github.com, "About large files on GitHub"), so
# the app cannot download it from a commit the way it did the prototype's
# 2^20 one. Where it is hosted is still to be decided (README.md,
# "Distribution"). SHA256SUMS still lists its digest. Witnesses and proofs
# stay local.
target/*
!target/coinbase_attestation_v2.json
!target/coinbase_attestation_v2.srs.toolchain
!target/SHA256SUMS
!target/CoinbaseAttestationV2.sol
!target/vk/
target/vk/*
!target/vk/vk
!target/vk/vk_hash
!target/vk/SHA256SUMS
